Salesforce does not allow HTTP callouts directly inside an Apex trigger, so I deviate by having the trigger enqueue a Queueable job. The callout is still one HTTP request per new account (single-element JSON array), and chunks of 100 keep each Queueable transaction within the 100-callout-per-transaction limit.

